[{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l014","ordinal":190209,"en":"Your Bakai wanders distraught."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l015","ordinal":190210,"en":"When that Manas was alive,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l016","ordinal":190211,"en":"Why did I not then behold"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l017","ordinal":190212,"en":"The ground below, like Judgment Day?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l018","ordinal":190213,"en":"When my lion, my gray-maned wolf, was alive,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l019","ordinal":190214,"en":"Why did I not die then?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l020","ordinal":190215,"en":"O beard of one who felled the foe,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l021","ordinal":190216,"en":"Parted from my tiger,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l022","ordinal":190217,"en":"Is this your time to lie upon the ridge?!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l023","ordinal":190218,"en":"When my black-steel Zulfiqar"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l024","ordinal":190219,"en":"Hung smoking at my side,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l025","ordinal":190220,"en":"When I drove back"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l026","ordinal":190221,"en":"All who attacked,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l027","ordinal":190222,"en":"When I kept my sharp, lamb-ribbed spear"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l028","ordinal":190223,"en":"Bound ready at my side;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l029","ordinal":190224,"en":"When I drove back many peoples,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l030","ordinal":190225,"en":"To say nothing of the Chinese;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l031","ordinal":190226,"en":"When my world was wide, not narrowed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l032","ordinal":190227,"en":"In the time of fortunate Manas—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l033","ordinal":190228,"en":"Why did I not die then?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l034","ordinal":190229,"en":"When, if bored, we hunted deer,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l035","ordinal":190230,"en":"And if not, in Talas"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l036","ordinal":190231,"en":"We passed our days in freedom;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l037","ordinal":190232,"en":"When I wore my paired sable cap"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l038","ordinal":190233,"en":"And set it jauntily,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b003:l039","ordinal":190234,"en":"Lamenting and singing with the hero,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l001","ordinal":190235,"en":"With my dear lion Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l002","ordinal":190236,"en":"When I lived in joy—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l003","ordinal":190237,"en":"Why did I not die here then?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l004","ordinal":190238,"en":"My long-suffering Manas, if only you had not died,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l005","ordinal":190239,"en":"My sheep sharing one fold,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l006","ordinal":190240,"en":"My food sharing one circle of companions."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l007","ordinal":190241,"en":"My valiant Manas, if only you had not died,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l008","ordinal":190242,"en":"So Bakai need not whiten a beard like a swan,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l009","ordinal":190243,"en":"Nor redden eyes like a raven’s,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l010","ordinal":190244,"en":"Nor live to see this torment."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l011","ordinal":190245,"en":"Who did not cock the sable cap upon his head"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l012","ordinal":190246,"en":"And wear it with a flourish?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l013","ordinal":190247,"en":"When strength remained in his arm,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l014","ordinal":190248,"en":"Who did not walk the earth roaring?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l015","ordinal":190249,"en":"Before that noble soul’s venom,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l016","ordinal":190250,"en":"Did the Kakan’s people not tremble?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l017","ordinal":190251,"en":"Even distant Beijing, beyond a stallion’s reach,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l018","ordinal":190252,"en":"We fought until we made it submit;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l019","ordinal":190253,"en":"It was an army that trampled"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l020","ordinal":190254,"en":"The swaggering Kalcha."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l021","ordinal":190255,"en":"We scattered the army he had gathered,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l022","ordinal":190256,"en":"And when we cast Beijing into turmoil,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l023","ordinal":190257,"en":"We took the daughters of Beijing’s lords"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l024","ordinal":190258,"en":"And carried them away as prizes."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l025","ordinal":190259,"en":"Why did I not die then?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l026","ordinal":190260,"en":"Great Beijing, that city with its court—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l027","ordinal":190261,"en":"We broke Beijing and took its realm,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l028","ordinal":190262,"en":"Loaded gold pieces upon camels,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l029","ordinal":190263,"en":"And took a thousand dark-eyed maidens."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l030","ordinal":190264,"en":"My name, Bakai, split the stones;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l031","ordinal":190265,"en":"When I was mighty and strong,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l032","ordinal":190266,"en":"Why did I not die then?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l033","ordinal":190267,"en":"When the pitch-black city’s ruler"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l034","ordinal":190268,"en":"I held surrounded,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l035","ordinal":190269,"en":"When I beat the black Chinese and many Manchus,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l036","ordinal":190270,"en":"Roasting their people like wheat,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l037","ordinal":190271,"en":"And scourged them;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l038","ordinal":190272,"en":"When, in this accursed false world,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0053:b004:l039","ordinal":190273,"en":"My wing, Manas, was still beside me,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l001","ordinal":190274,"en":"Why did I not perish then?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l002","ordinal":190275,"en":"Ah, my son Semetey,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l003","ordinal":190276,"en":"May you be ruined if you call this taking horses!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l004","ordinal":190277,"en":"Among the swarming Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l005","ordinal":190278,"en":"One who slaughtered the people and took their herds—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l006","ordinal":190279,"en":"Could he have an heir like you?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l007","ordinal":190280,"en":"Can anyone prosper who calls you a living man?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l008","ordinal":190281,"en":"My son, had you never been born, sink into darkness;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l009","ordinal":190282,"en":"Rather than live, go and die!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l010","ordinal":190283,"en":"Drink stones instead of liquor;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l011","ordinal":190284,"en":"And if that is too little, my foal,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l012","ordinal":190285,"en":"Mix in your elder Bakai’s blood and drink!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l013","ordinal":190286,"en":"You boast without cause,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l014","ordinal":190287,"en":"Saying you went to make war"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l015","ordinal":190288,"en":"Upon the innumerable Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l016","ordinal":190289,"en":"Saying you raided the horses"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l017","ordinal":190290,"en":"Of a Kalda who lived out on the frontier."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l018","ordinal":190291,"en":"There is no stallion and no riding horse,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l019","ordinal":190292,"en":"Not one fit to mount in battle."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l020","ordinal":190293,"en":"Be swept away together with your herd!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l021","ordinal":190294,"en":"The devils you have driven here"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l022","ordinal":190295,"en":"Belong to a half-lunged Kalda;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l023","ordinal":190296,"en":"Deceived in a wretched place,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l024","ordinal":190297,"en":"Could a champion be like you?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l025","ordinal":190298,"en":"Has anyone who calls you a hero"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l026","ordinal":190299,"en":"Ever prospered since ancient times?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l027","ordinal":190300,"en":"You have driven here"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l028","ordinal":190301,"en":"The lice swarming at his collar;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l029","ordinal":190302,"en":"They are all unbroken colts and fillies—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l030","ordinal":190303,"en":"You have driven here his dogs."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l031","ordinal":190304,"en":"From the sleeping Kalmak"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l032","ordinal":190305,"en":"You have driven here his cows;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l033","ordinal":190306,"en":"From the Kalda lying in a hollow,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l034","ordinal":190307,"en":"You have driven here his sheep."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l035","ordinal":190308,"en":"Among the horses you brought,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l036","ordinal":190309,"en":"There is no mount fit for a firefight,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l037","ordinal":190310,"en":"Not one fit to ride on campaign!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l038","ordinal":190311,"en":"Rather than raid horses of this sort,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b003:l039","ordinal":190312,"en":"Could you not have returned empty-handed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l001","ordinal":190313,"en":"Saying, “Fighting the black Kalmak,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l002","ordinal":190314,"en":"My strength failed me,”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l003","ordinal":190315,"en":"And come back ruined?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l004","ordinal":190316,"en":"You rejoice, it seems,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l005","ordinal":190317,"en":"Saying you have taken many horses—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l006","ordinal":190318,"en":"Yet my noble lion Manas, companion of my youth,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l007","ordinal":190319,"en":"Could have urinated upon stones at your age!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l008","ordinal":190320,"en":"If only Manas had died before he was born!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l009","ordinal":190321,"en":"My noble son, look upon"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l010","ordinal":190322,"en":"These horses you have driven here!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l011","ordinal":190323,"en":"Does a hero not die of shame?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l012","ordinal":190324,"en":"When fate casts it upon his head,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l013","ordinal":190325,"en":"Does a doomed young man not see it?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l014","ordinal":190326,"en":"Among all these horses,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l015","ordinal":190327,"en":"There is not one fine beast"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l016","ordinal":190328,"en":"To ride with graceful bearing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l017","ordinal":190329,"en":"At a memorial feast or celebration;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l018","ordinal":190330,"en":"There is not one fit to gird on the Zhozhura sword"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l019","ordinal":190331,"en":"And circle the face of the earth,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l020","ordinal":190332,"en":"Not one beast fit to ride into conflict."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l021","ordinal":190333,"en":"Though you pull the saddle girth tight,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l022","ordinal":190334,"en":"There is not one fit to ride into battle!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l023","ordinal":190335,"en":"Kulchoro and Kanchoro—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l024","ordinal":190336,"en":"Muradyl had raided away their horses,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l025","ordinal":190337,"en":"And when we drove them on foot, they would not walk;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l026","ordinal":190338,"en":"If we mounted them behind us, there was no room,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l027","ordinal":190339,"en":"So the two were left on foot in the steppe."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l028","ordinal":190340,"en":"They thought their elder would raid horses,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l029","ordinal":190341,"en":"And drive them back toward us;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l030","ordinal":190342,"en":"They hoped he would take"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l031","ordinal":190343,"en":"At least one thoroughbred racing horse, unless he were a dog."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l032","ordinal":190344,"en":"The hopes of those two"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l033","ordinal":190345,"en":"Were dashed against stone on the steppe."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l034","ordinal":190346,"en":"Semetey, in whom I placed my hope—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l035","ordinal":190347,"en":"My son, despairing of you,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l036","ordinal":190348,"en":"Bakai’s mouth has fallen closed."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l037","ordinal":190349,"en":"He was your equal, your companion in age;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l038","ordinal":190350,"en":"Parted from the companion of his own age,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0054:b004:l039","ordinal":190351,"en":"This Bakai standing here—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l001","ordinal":190352,"en":"What a variety I said!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l002","ordinal":190353,"en":"The mare took the net,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l003","ordinal":190354,"en":"You've had enough"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l004","ordinal":190355,"en":"Take a slave with a slave,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l005","ordinal":190356,"en":"Will you be the one chasing revenge?! –"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l006","ordinal":190357,"en":"Saying, the old man Bakay,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l007","ordinal":190358,"en":"Sad tune,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l008","ordinal":190359,"en":"Speaking to Semetei,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l009","ordinal":190360,"en":"Pulling out his beard and throwing it away"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l010","ordinal":190361,"en":"Twisting his mustache and throwing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l011","ordinal":190362,"en":"Golden cheeks,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l012","ordinal":190363,"en":"Leaning on an empty stomach,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l013","ordinal":190364,"en":"Dear Manas, don't die."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l014","ordinal":190365,"en":"His white beard is thinning,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l015","ordinal":190366,"en":"Tears flowing down two faces,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l016","ordinal":190367,"en":"Uncle Bakay Kargan,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l017","ordinal":190368,"en":"Poured down slowly,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l018","ordinal":190369,"en":"Sweet soul says to die"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l019","ordinal":190370,"en":"It is hard to come in."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l020","ordinal":190371,"en":"Your grandfather, Kargan Bakay,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l021","ordinal":190372,"en":"Sad horse"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l022","ordinal":190373,"en":"Kutpa drove the side."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l023","ordinal":190374,"en":"Semetey fell under it,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l024","ordinal":190375,"en":"He is brave, he has no sense,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l025","ordinal":190376,"en":"Know the tenderness from this,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l026","ordinal":190377,"en":"What is a man out of the blue?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l027","ordinal":190378,"en":"Father Manas is from Kojjal,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l028","ordinal":190379,"en":"What is the relative of the rear?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l029","ordinal":190380,"en":"To the place of rebellion,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l030","ordinal":190381,"en":"A sycamore is planted like a yard,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l031","ordinal":190382,"en":"I am descended from Ukuman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l032","ordinal":190383,"en":"He supported from the beginning."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l033","ordinal":190384,"en":"Dear Taibuurul,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l034","ordinal":190385,"en":"Take the hangover,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l035","ordinal":190386,"en":"Are you in the news?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l036","ordinal":190387,"en":"Akkelte summer is like this,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l037","ordinal":190388,"en":"Every side of Anjiyan,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l038","ordinal":190389,"en":"As for Amangen,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b003:l039","ordinal":190390,"en":"The domain of Kokon Khan,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l001","ordinal":190391,"en":"From Idai Sary-Talaa,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l002","ordinal":190392,"en":"Sixty Russian land surveyors,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l003","ordinal":190393,"en":"When the special comes out,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l004","ordinal":190394,"en":"The air of Kiran Bakay,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l005","ordinal":190395,"en":"The day before the ambassador came down,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l006","ordinal":190396,"en":"When the Russian does not give,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l007","ordinal":190397,"en":"All in a row,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l008","ordinal":190398,"en":"Wearing yellow"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l009","ordinal":190399,"en":"All in a row,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l010","ordinal":190400,"en":"who owns his slaves,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l011","ordinal":190401,"en":"Riding a wild mare,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l012","ordinal":190402,"en":"Eighty sunny days,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l013","ordinal":190403,"en":"A beautiful old man,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l014","ordinal":190404,"en":"Akkelte received from Kerish"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l015","ordinal":190405,"en":"Ochogor when playing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l016","ordinal":190406,"en":"Actually Koychakir,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l017","ordinal":190407,"en":"Surplus iron Almabash,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l018","ordinal":190408,"en":"Indestructible in sixty days."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l019","ordinal":190409,"en":"You are four months pregnant,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l020","ordinal":190410,"en":"Estimated location,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l021","ordinal":190411,"en":"If a shot comes out of his mouth"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l022","ordinal":190412,"en":"If not alive."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l023","ordinal":190413,"en":"Father Manas is from noble-hearted."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l024","ordinal":190414,"en":"Akkelte, the depositor,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l025","ordinal":190415,"en":"Even if he hangs himself,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l026","ordinal":190416,"en":"Aidaly's glass,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l027","ordinal":190417,"en":"If stretched out on a cross,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b004:l028","ordinal":190418,"en":"Savings is the pastime of the soul."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0055:b0